<div class="article-section" id="">
<h3>Perception of environment</h3>
<p>The distribution and mean of each Active Commuting Route Environment Scale item is presented in <a class="xref-fig" href="#F3">Figure 3</a>. The car related traffic characteristics had highest means. The conflicts frequency, route difficulties, and elevation items had a bimodal distribution.</p>
